<title>FRANCE: Salomon 96/97 net attrib rises four pct.</title>
<headline>Salomon 96/97 net attrib rises four pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     214  vs	     206</p>
<p>    Pre-tax					  362  vs	     376</p>
<p>    Operating					419  vs	     487</p>
<p>    Turnover				     4,420  vs	   4,006</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)			3.3  up 10 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said turnover in the current financial year could rise by more than 10 percent to five billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
